{
  "name": "20 - Invoice Generator & Payment Reminder",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 20 - Invoice Generator & Payment Reminder\n\n**What it does:**\nChecks Stripe for overdue unpaid invoices daily. Sends email reminders to customers. After 2nd reminder, escalates to Slack. Tracks reminder count in Airtable.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Add Stripe API key to credentials\n2. Configure SMTP credentials for sending emails\n3. Set SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL environment variable\n4. Create Airtable base with table `Invoice Reminders`:\n   - Invoice ID (text, primary)\n   - Customer Email (email)\n   - Customer Name (text)\n   - Amount (currency)\n   - Due Date (date)\n   - Reminder Count (number)\n   - Last Reminded (date)\n   - Status (single select: Pending/Paid/Escalated)\n5. Set AIRTABLE_BASE_ID in the config node\n\n**Schedule:** Runs daily at 9AM",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 360
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000001",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, -180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [{ "field": "cronExpression", "expression": "0 9 * * *" }]
        }
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000002",
      "name": "Daily 9AM Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-001",
              "name": "AIRTABLE_BASE_ID",
              "value": "appXXXXXXXXXXXXXX",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-002",
              "name": "OVERDUE_DAYS_THRESHOLD",
              "value": 7,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-003",
              "name": "FROM_EMAIL",
              "value": "billing@yourcompany.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-004",
              "name": "COMPANY_NAME",
              "value": "Your Company Name",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000003",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [480, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://api.stripe.com/v1/invoices",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "status", "value": "open" },
            { "name": "limit", "value": "100" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000004",
      "name": "Fetch Overdue Invoices",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [720, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const invoices = $input.item.json.data || [];\nconst threshold = $('Config').item.json.OVERDUE_DAYS_THRESHOLD;\nconst now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);\nconst thresholdSeconds = threshold * 24 * 60 * 60;\n\nconst overdue = invoices.filter(inv => {\n  const dueDate = inv.due_date || inv.created;\n  return (now - dueDate) > thresholdSeconds;\n});\n\nreturn overdue.map(inv => ({\n  json: {\n    invoice_id: inv.id,\n    invoice_number: inv.number || inv.id,\n    customer_email: inv.customer_email,\n    customer_name: inv.customer_name || inv.customer_email,\n    amount_due: (inv.amount_due / 100).toFixed(2),\n    currency: (inv.currency || 'inr').toUpperCase(),\n    due_date: inv.due_date ? new Date(inv.due_date * 1000).toLocaleDateString('en-IN') : 'N/A',\n    hosted_invoice_url: inv.hosted_invoice_url || '',\n    days_overdue: Math.floor((now - (inv.due_date || inv.created)) / 86400)\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000005",
      "name": "Filter Overdue",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [960, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "search",
        "baseId": "={{ $('Config').item.json.AIRTABLE_BASE_ID }}",
        "tableId": "Invoice Reminders",
        "filterByFormula": "={Invoice ID}='{{ $json.invoice_id }}'",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000006",
      "name": "Check Airtable Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1200, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "airtableTokenApi": {
          "id": "airtable-cred",
          "name": "Airtable API"
        }
      },
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.records ? $json.records.length : 0 }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000007",
      "name": "First Reminder?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1440, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "baseId": "={{ $('Config').item.json.AIRTABLE_BASE_ID }}",
        "tableId": "Invoice Reminders",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Invoice ID": "={{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.invoice_id }}",
            "Customer Email": "={{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.customer_email }}",
            "Customer Name": "={{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.customer_name }}",
            "Amount": "={{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.amount_due }}",
            "Due Date": "={{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.due_date }}",
            "Reminder Count": 1,
            "Last Reminded": "={{ new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0] }}",
            "Status": "Pending"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000008",
      "name": "Create Reminder Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1680, 160],
      "credentials": {
        "airtableTokenApi": {
          "id": "airtable-cred",
          "name": "Airtable API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "baseId": "={{ $('Config').item.json.AIRTABLE_BASE_ID }}",
        "tableId": "Invoice Reminders",
        "id": "={{ $json.records[0].id }}",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Reminder Count": "={{ ($json.records[0].fields['Reminder Count'] || 0) + 1 }}",
            "Last Reminded": "={{ new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0] }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000009",
      "name": "Increment Reminder Count",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1680, 440],
      "credentials": {
        "airtableTokenApi": {
          "id": "airtable-cred",
          "name": "Airtable API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.customer_email }}",
        "subject": "=Payment Reminder — Invoice #{{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.invoice_number }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><body style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px\">\n<h2 style=\"color:#d32f2f\">Payment Reminder</h2>\n<p>Dear {{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.customer_name }},</p>\n<p>This is a friendly reminder that the following invoice is overdue:</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:20px 0\">\n  <tr style=\"background:#f5f5f5\">\n    <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #ddd\"><strong>Invoice Number</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">#{{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.invoice_number }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #ddd\"><strong>Amount Due</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">{{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.currency }} {{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.amount_due }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr style=\"background:#f5f5f5\">\n    <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #ddd\"><strong>Due Date</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">{{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.due_date }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #ddd\"><strong>Days Overdue</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #ddd;color:#d32f2f\">{{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.days_overdue }} days</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n{% if $('Filter Overdue').item.json.hosted_invoice_url %}\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"{{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.hosted_invoice_url }}\" style=\"background:#1976d2;color:white;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px\">Pay Now</a>\n</p>\n{% endif %}\n<p>If you have already made the payment, please disregard this reminder.</p>\n<p>For any questions, please reply to this email.</p>\n<p>Regards,<br>{{ $('Config').item.json.COMPANY_NAME }}</p>\n</body></html>",
        "options": {
          "fromEmail": "={{ $('Config').item.json.FROM_EMAIL }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000010",
      "name": "Send Reminder Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1920, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "smtp-cred",
          "name": "SMTP"
        }
      },
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "esc-001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Check Airtable Record').item.json.records?.[0]?.fields?.['Reminder Count'] || 0 }}",
              "rightValue": 1,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gte" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000011",
      "name": "Escalate?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [2160, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "text",
              "value": "=*ESCALATION — Overdue Invoice*\nCustomer: {{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.customer_name }} ({{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.customer_email }})\nInvoice: #{{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.invoice_number }}\nAmount: {{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.currency }} {{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.amount_due }}\nDays Overdue: {{ $('Filter Overdue').item.json.days_overdue }}\nThis is the 2nd+ reminder. Manual follow-up required."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-0003-0003-0003-000000000012",
      "name": "Escalate to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2400, 200]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 9AM Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Config", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Fetch Overdue Invoices", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch Overdue Invoices": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Filter Overdue", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Filter Overdue": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Check Airtable Record", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Check Airtable Record": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "First Reminder?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "First Reminder?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Create Reminder Record", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Increment Reminder Count", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Create Reminder Record": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Send Reminder Email", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Increment Reminder Count": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Send Reminder Email", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Send Reminder Email": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Escalate?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Escalate?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Escalate to Slack", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
